  "astar": "a search that always expands the open cell with the smallest sum of steps taken so far plus an estimate of the steps remaining to the goal",
  "gbfs": "a search that always expands the open cell with the smallest estimate of the steps remaining to the goal, ignoring the steps taken so far"
